{"assertionId":"08d32b1c-bac2-48ba-b447-5de1de790af9","entityBindings":[],"fragments":[{"exactText":"The DunedinPACE™ algorithm can track how fast the body is aging and the impact of lifestyle changes.","fragmentId":"sha256:eecb46671f32862e2f7493bd738e4872880b21485d679efcf5f154b208f7d529"}],"proposition":"The page states that DunedinPACE provides a definitive medical diagnosis.","qualifiers":[],"rubricVersion":"evidence-only.v1"}